# The Klaro release the fixture serves, pinned by version and digest.
#
# Pinned because an unpinned CMP would make wsaw's test suite fail on
# somebody else's release schedule (Story 7.1, AC1), and checksummed because
# "we fetched whatever was at that URL" is not a pin.
#
# Klaro is BSD-3-Clause (KIProtect GmbH). It is fetched when the fixture
# image is built, never at scan time, so a scan makes no network request
# outside the stack (Tenet 14).
#
# To move to a new release: change both lines, then run
#   make e2e-fixture-image
# which fails if the digest does not match.
KLARO_VERSION=0.7.21
KLARO_SHA256=3a917a9ebdbed33f555326669db35fc03e0d0fffa5ecd5db08a34769c2c76596
